   "name": "Phylogenetic trait mapping to find the function of a divergent fungal actin (iced)",
   "description": "Can phylogenetic trait mapping reveal the function of a structurally divergent actin isoform conserved across fungi, by finding a species-level trait that predicts its presence or absence?",
